{"id":50777,"date":"2026-04-23T22:32:18","date_gmt":"2026-04-23T21:32:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50777"},"modified":"2026-09-04T17:26:49","modified_gmt":"2026-09-04T16:26:49","slug":"douro-ultra-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/douro-ultra-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Douro Ultra Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Douro Ultra Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Douro Ultra Trail 2026 (DUT)<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das mais \u00e9picas e prestigiadas provas de trail running e ultra endurance de Portugal, disputada nas encostas esculpidas em socalcos do <strong>Alto Douro Vinhateiro<\/strong> (Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO), com centro nevr\u00e1lgico no <strong>Peso da R\u00e9gua<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Vila Real<\/strong>).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta no Cais da R\u00e9gua junto ao Rio Douro, o evento integra o circuito oficial da <strong>ATRP<\/strong> e oferece quatro desafios monumentais: <strong>DUT 100K (100 km com 5000m D+)<\/strong>, <strong>DUT 50K (50 km)<\/strong>, <strong>DUT 28K (28 km)<\/strong> e o <strong>DUT 15K (15 km)<\/strong>, com participa\u00e7\u00e3o individual ou em duplas. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Nexplore<\/strong> garante pontos de abastecimento de excel\u00eancia, medalhas gravadas exclusivas, live tracking por GPS e seguran\u00e7a em montanha.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">9 e 10 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 23:59<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.0